[6.724, "o", "probe: the three syscalls the wall needs, in order (KiroCrew's probe shape \u2014 see docs/FREE_GATE.md)\r\n"]
[6.738, "o", "probe: 1 unshare(CLONE_NEWUSER): PASS \u2014 ok\r\n"]
[6.744, "o", "probe: 2 unshare(CLONE_NEWNS): PASS \u2014 ok\r\n"]
[6.808, "o", "probe: 3 mount (remount / private inside the namespaces): PASS \u2014 ok\r\nprobe: cap-drop: /usr/bin/setpriv present \u2014 CAP_SYS_ADMIN is dropped before the agent runs\r\nprobe: PASS \u2014 all three syscalls work; the wall can run here\r\n"]
